"mapCap": "The dotted line follows the journey as Smyth tells it: from Zoan to Succoth, through the sea, to Sinai, to Kadesh and Mount Hor, and round Edom to the plains of Moab. He passes over the long list of camps in Numbers 33, saying that most of the names are “lost in obscurity”. Many of these places are not known for certain; the likeliest is shown.",
