"id": "fengyang",
"title": "凤阳花鼓",
"when": "Suggested",
"by": "Anhui folk song (安徽民歌), popular in Ming and Qing times",
"note": "A drum-song sung by wandering singers from Fengyang. This old verse tells of hard years in Fengyang; \"咚得隆咚锵\" is the sound of the drum and gong. The verses beginning 左手锣 右手鼓 are a 1934 arrangement by 黎锦晖, still under copyright here, so add them with \"My words\" if you want them.",
"lyrics": "说凤阳　道凤阳　凤阳本是好地方\nshuō fèng yáng　dào fèng yáng　fèng yáng běn shì hǎo dì fang\n自从出了朱皇帝　十年倒有九年荒\nzì cóng chū le zhū huáng dì　shí nián dào yǒu jiǔ nián huāng\n咚得隆咚锵　咚得隆咚锵　咚得隆咚锵咚锵咚锵\ndōng de lōng dōng qiāng\n大户人家卖牛羊　小户人家卖儿郎\ndà hù rén jiā mài niú yáng　xiǎo hù rén jiā mài ér láng\n奴家没有儿郎卖　身背花鼓走四方\nnú jiā méi yǒu ér láng mài　shēn bēi huā gǔ zǒu sì fāng\n咚得隆咚锵　咚得隆咚锵　咚得隆咚锵咚锵咚锵",
"lyricsSrc": "Traditional verse as given in Chinese Wikipedia, 凤阳花鼓 (Wikipedia prints 十年到有九年荒; 到 here means 倒). Pinyin added."
