"steps": [
"Construct an oblong 6\" × 12\" of manila paper — strong and not too heavy.",
"Place dots on the top and bottom at 1\", 3\", 5\", 7\", 9\", 11\"; draw lines.",
"Turn the paper over from top to bottom, the left and right edges being unchanged.",
"Place dots on the top and bottom at 2\", 4\", 6\", 8\", 10\"; draw lines.",
"Fold and crease the lines first on one side, then on the other.",
"Construct another fan in the same manner and paste together the outer folds of the two fans.",
"Hold the folds together and punch two holes near the bottom. Tie with a cord.",
"The fan may be decorated before being folded."
],
