"title": "Year 3: the compass, and longer models",
"forWho": "Read with Mum before the first model.",
"text": [
[
"What’s new",
"Year 3 brings a compass (a sturdy one: the flimsy kind from a geometry set doesn’t work well) and longer, more exact models. Joanna: the book’s directions “are becoming more and more succinct”; if you skip ahead “you may find the instructions incomprehensible”."
],
[
"Take your time",
"Several models are long or tricky (the bank, the letter holder). Split them over two sessions if needed, and remake a model until the skill feels easy."
]
],
