"text": [
[
"Brush drill",
"Take the brush in the right hand; discuss its two ends. Point upwards; downwards; to the left-hand side; to the right-hand side. Lay the dry brush on the chequers in four directions, and measure the length of the brush. It should cover two chequers."
],
[
"Brush-forms",
"Fill the brush with colour, and lay it on the chequers in the first position, viz.: pointing upwards, and raise it again without moving it on the paper. The result is a picture of the brush, or Brush-form. Continue these until made correctly. Proceed in the same way to teach the other three directions."
]
]
